Z||000006||MinnGreenGT||09-18-2001||10:18 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JayUSA77:<BR><B>i wanna see clear tail lights for the GT, maybe even euro, i dont know if i would like it but it would be a thought to make<BR>j<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Jay-<P>I finally finished both protype pieces for the GT, but haven't gotten ahold of the LEDs yet.  As soon as I get the set finished I'll be posting both daytime and nightime pics.  Did you see the original thread on the clear GT taillights?  <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010073.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010073.html</A> <P>quikGTA... that is EXACTLY the same piece of material I'm working with!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Looks cool! Much more "Finished" in appearance   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  You need to shoot a nighttime photo with the lights lit!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfpole.gif">   <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett<p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 09-18-2001).]||||reg||1
